# For each word the note is shown, and a word with `+` writes over it: the first round reads the note as it was, and a
# later round writes on it, though the write stands above the read in the loop. Read, then written: both.

route loopnote.run
line entry > run call
line File(data/note.txt) > run own
line run > File(data/note.txt) own
line run > Screen own

side entry left
side File(data/note.txt) both
side Screen right
